1
00:00:00,433 --> 00:00:03,233
You're the one I like, Suzuki.

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:07,933
Do you really like me?

3
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:13,067
Then let's keep doing it until you get it.

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,100
A dream?!

5
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:26,867
(Serizawa Haruto: You were so cute
today, too. I love you. Good night.)

6
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,133
Thank goodness.

7
00:00:31,233 --> 00:00:32,867
It wasn't a dream.

8
00:00:38,133 --> 00:00:41,833
It's been a week since
Serizawa and I started dating.

9
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,433
I still can't believe it.

10
00:00:53,533 --> 00:00:55,100
Morning, Suzuki.

11
00:00:55,567 --> 00:00:56,867
Morning.

12
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:00,700
Cute as always today.

13
00:01:09,267 --> 00:01:10,633
I like you.

14
00:01:15,667 --> 00:01:18,567
Suzuki, you're pretty bold
this early in the morning.

15
00:01:18,667 --> 00:01:19,767
N-No, that's not it.

16
00:01:19,867 --> 00:01:23,333
I was just making sure
having you here isn't a dream.

17
00:01:24,133 --> 00:01:25,900
What's that about?

18
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,033
Shouldn't you be used to it by now?

19
00:01:29,133 --> 00:01:32,067
Well, it's you, Serizawa...

20
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:37,033
I'll let you take your time
making sure later, then.

21
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,867
Somewhere with just the two of us.

22
00:01:44,667 --> 00:01:47,167
Shy Suzuki is so cute.

23
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,367
So, how much more do you need to check

24
00:01:52,467 --> 00:01:55,067
until you accept that I'm
really right in front of you?

25
00:02:00,967 --> 00:02:02,167
Let's go.

26
00:02:11,533 --> 00:02:15,067
Come to think of it, Serizawa has a point.

27
00:02:15,833 --> 00:02:19,433
After all, Serizawa and I...

28
00:02:19,533 --> 00:02:21,867
have already kissed four times.

29
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,667
Our first kiss...

30
00:02:27,767 --> 00:02:30,167
was before we even confessed to each other.

31
00:02:30,933 --> 00:02:34,233
The second was when we started going out.

32
00:02:34,767 --> 00:02:37,000
The third was three days
ago, right after gym class.

33
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:41,033
Wait, I can't breathe.

34
00:02:41,133 --> 00:02:43,367
Breathe through your nose, Suzuki.

35
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,333
The fourth...

36
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:49,067
was yesterday after school.

37
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,133
And now...

38
00:02:54,233 --> 00:02:56,267
Where are we going?

39
00:02:56,367 --> 00:02:58,300
Just come here.

40
00:03:09,667 --> 00:03:11,167
The fifth.

41
00:03:14,067 --> 00:03:17,200
Well? Still think it's a dream?

42
00:03:18,367 --> 00:03:20,967
Y-Yeah.

43
00:03:24,733 --> 00:03:28,967
Even I can tell it's real now...

44
00:03:29,467 --> 00:03:33,200
I know it's real, but...

45
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:17,367
"Popular Serizawa Acts Weird Around Me"

46
00:04:17,967 --> 00:04:18,967
(Banana Lake)

47
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,600
And?

48
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:22,367
(Episode 11)
What is there to even worry about?

49
00:04:22,467 --> 00:04:26,100
Like I said... Um,
Iwasaki, are you listening?

50
00:04:26,567 --> 00:04:27,867
Sorry, I zoned out.

51
00:04:27,967 --> 00:04:29,567
So, what's today's agenda?

52
00:04:29,667 --> 00:04:34,833
About how Suzuki's Serizawa
is too hot for his own good.

53
00:04:34,933 --> 00:04:36,467
Huh?

54
00:04:36,567 --> 00:04:41,233
To be exact, it's about how my
Serizawa is ridiculously handsome.

55
00:04:41,333 --> 00:04:42,533
Same difference.

56
00:04:42,633 --> 00:04:43,233
Totally.

57
00:04:43,333 --> 00:04:44,879
You're just flexing on us.

58
00:04:44,904 --> 00:04:46,633
No, I'm not!

59
00:04:46,733 --> 00:04:49,500
How do I put it? I just...
can't handle it at all.

60
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,433
Just being around Serizawa...

61
00:04:51,533 --> 00:04:55,200
makes my heart race like crazy.

62
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:58,267
And even when we kiss...
breathing through my nose?

63
00:04:58,367 --> 00:05:00,633
I can't even get that right. And besides...

64
00:05:00,733 --> 00:05:02,209
Serizawa is always so cool and collected.

65
00:05:02,233 --> 00:05:03,843
I'm the only one who can't keep his cool.

66
00:05:03,867 --> 00:05:06,700
My heart won't stop pounding,
and I'm a complete nervous wreck...

67
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:11,033
Plus, my first boyfriend ever is gorgeous.

68
00:05:11,133 --> 00:05:13,867
It feels like the whole
universe is off-balance.

69
00:05:20,166 --> 00:05:23,166
Why are you guys smirking?

70
00:05:23,467 --> 00:05:25,133
Too cute...

71
00:05:25,233 --> 00:05:26,967
Do you guys actually get what I'm saying?

72
00:05:27,067 --> 00:05:31,767
Before that, we're taking a moment
to appreciate how adorable you are, Suzuki.

73
00:05:31,867 --> 00:05:33,376
Come on! That's not what I'm talking about!

74
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,433
Relax.

75
00:05:34,533 --> 00:05:38,033
We get that you think
Serizawa is hot, but...

76
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,967
the whole breathing through
your nose thing is just...

77
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:44,633
Stop cracking me up!

78
00:05:44,733 --> 00:05:46,133
It's not funny!

79
00:05:46,233 --> 00:05:47,133
Ah.

80
00:05:47,233 --> 00:05:47,767
Hey, Saeki!

81
00:05:47,867 --> 00:05:48,533
Hmm?

82
00:05:48,633 --> 00:05:49,633
Let me practice on you.

83
00:05:49,667 --> 00:05:50,767
Huh? Practice what?

84
00:05:50,867 --> 00:05:51,500
Breathing through my nose.

85
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,233
No way in hell!

86
00:05:53,333 --> 00:05:55,000
Serizawa will literally murder me.

87
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:56,267
Then Takeuchi...

88
00:05:56,367 --> 00:05:58,133
I don't have a death wish either.

89
00:05:58,233 --> 00:05:59,100
Then Iwasaki!

90
00:05:59,200 --> 00:05:59,867
Iwasaki is so nice.

91
00:05:59,967 --> 00:06:01,800
You'll practice with me, right?

92
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:04,367
Sure, I'm down.

93
00:06:04,467 --> 00:06:05,667
- Really?
- Absolutely not.

94
00:06:05,767 --> 00:06:07,100
Huh?

95
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,500
So, simply put,

96
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:15,233
you hate that you're the only one
getting flustered, right?

97
00:06:15,333 --> 00:06:17,233
Yeah, pretty much...

98
00:06:17,333 --> 00:06:21,133
Then why don't you make
Serizawa's heart race, too?

99
00:06:21,233 --> 00:06:22,567
Yeah.

100
00:06:22,667 --> 00:06:24,933
Me? Make Serizawa flustered?

101
00:06:25,767 --> 00:06:27,233
How would I do that?

102
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:31,500
Oh, why not look at the
BL manga you like for ideas?

103
00:06:32,167 --> 00:06:32,600
BL...?

104
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:33,700
Yeah.

105
00:06:33,733 --> 00:06:38,167
Awesome! The Autumn BL Festival:

106
00:06:38,267 --> 00:06:41,000
Suzuki's Heart-Throbbing Operation!

107
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:42,633
Ta-da!

108
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,900
Use BL as a reference...

109
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,867
Yeah.

110
00:06:45,967 --> 00:06:47,209
I'll be the one to make Serizawa...

111
00:06:47,233 --> 00:06:48,500
Mm-hmm.

112
00:06:51,333 --> 00:06:52,567
This is it.

113
00:06:52,667 --> 00:06:53,300
Thanks, guys.

114
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,200
Ooh.

115
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:55,500
Alright...

116
00:06:56,067 --> 00:06:58,000
Operation Heart-Throb!

117
00:06:58,100 --> 00:06:59,876
- It really rolls off the tongue.
- True that.

118
00:06:59,900 --> 00:07:01,167
That's not the point.

119
00:07:01,267 --> 00:07:02,543
You're actually taking proper notes.

120
00:07:02,567 --> 00:07:03,667
Nice.

121
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:05,567
What are you writing?

122
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:06,800
Ooh...

123
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:07,900
Ah, wait!

124
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,567
Don't look at my notes!

125
00:07:09,667 --> 00:07:10,776
Does watching make it hard to write?

126
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,800
Wouldn't this help ease the tension?

127
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:13,533
I guess so.

128
00:07:13,633 --> 00:07:15,067
Iwasaki?

129
00:07:15,167 --> 00:07:16,067
I probably wouldn't know either, right?

130
00:07:16,167 --> 00:07:16,667
I don't know.

131
00:07:16,767 --> 00:07:18,333
Want to just throw something out there?

132
00:07:18,433 --> 00:07:19,000
Yeah.

133
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:19,933
Maybe some classical music would be good.

134
00:07:20,033 --> 00:07:21,033
Mm.

135
00:07:27,033 --> 00:07:28,033
Here.

136
00:07:28,567 --> 00:07:30,633
Operation: Make Serizawa Swoon

137
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:37,233
1. Casually whisper in his ear

138
00:07:38,167 --> 00:07:39,167
2. Kabedon (wall slam)

139
00:07:40,967 --> 00:07:44,800
3. Hug him suddenly from behind

140
00:07:45,767 --> 00:07:48,833
4. Lean against him tiredly.

141
00:07:48,933 --> 00:07:50,833
(Operation: Make Serizawa Swoon)
Let's review.

142
00:07:53,233 --> 00:07:54,667
Alright!

143
00:07:54,767 --> 00:07:58,367
Today, I'm definitely going
to make Serizawa's heart race.

144
00:08:08,933 --> 00:08:10,100
First up, Strategy One.

145
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,367
(Casually whisper in his ear)

146
00:08:12,933 --> 00:08:14,900
While Serizawa isn't paying attention...

147
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:18,133
a sweet whisper in his ear!

148
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:25,100
Suzuki?

149
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,933
Ah, sorry.

150
00:08:28,533 --> 00:08:32,067
Were you trying to kiss my ear just now?

151
00:08:32,167 --> 00:08:33,633
N-No, I wasn't!

152
00:08:35,433 --> 00:08:39,233
Oh... so that's your thing, Suzuki?

153
00:08:39,333 --> 00:08:40,533
It's not!

154
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:46,500
Next time, I'll do it to you.

155
00:08:47,633 --> 00:08:49,033
I said that's not it!

156
00:08:52,133 --> 00:08:53,367
Strategy Two.

157
00:08:55,133 --> 00:08:56,000
(The Wall Slam)

158
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:59,267
You can't go wrong
with a classic wall slam.

159
00:08:59,367 --> 00:09:00,433
See ya, catch you later.

160
00:09:03,267 --> 00:09:05,467
Seriously? Teach me next time!

161
00:09:05,867 --> 00:09:07,067
Hey there, Serizawa.

162
00:09:07,167 --> 00:09:08,233
Hey.

163
00:09:11,033 --> 00:09:12,533
Alright, now's my chance!

164
00:09:17,967 --> 00:09:19,600
Suzuki, are you okay?

165
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:21,367
Ah, yeah...

166
00:09:29,967 --> 00:09:31,800
Did you want to lean on me?

167
00:09:34,933 --> 00:09:36,233
Uh...

168
00:09:39,133 --> 00:09:42,533
Corn dogs definitely
taste best with ketchup.

169
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,500
Even though I forgot the mustard.

170
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:56,167
I have to nail it this time.

171
00:09:56,267 --> 00:09:57,533
Strategy Three.

172
00:09:58,533 --> 00:10:01,800
Grab his hand, pull it in assertively,
and take a bite like a boss!

173
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:05,767
Serizawa.

174
00:10:06,267 --> 00:10:08,967
Can I have a bite of that?

175
00:10:09,067 --> 00:10:10,833
Yeah, sure.

176
00:10:10,933 --> 00:10:12,133
Here.

177
00:10:12,867 --> 00:10:14,100
Now!

178
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,400
You got ketchup on your lip.

179
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:31,300
Huh, really? Where?

180
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:39,667
Thanks for the treat.

181
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:50,100
I can't do this.

182
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:55,667
Forget making his heart race...

183
00:10:56,733 --> 00:11:00,633
I'm the only one getting flustered here!

184
00:11:03,733 --> 00:11:05,167
Well, obviously.

185
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:09,600
Look, Suzuki's holding his head.

186
00:11:10,467 --> 00:11:12,433
Looks like the mission failed.

187
00:11:15,633 --> 00:11:17,867
Can't be helped.

188
00:11:19,667 --> 00:11:21,800
Guess I'll lend him a hand.

189
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:23,700
Lend a hand?

190
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,867
Yep.

191
00:11:24,967 --> 00:11:26,233
Or lend both hands, even.

192
00:11:27,467 --> 00:11:28,800
- Both hands?
- Yep.

193
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:30,433
What are you even saying?

194
00:11:31,233 --> 00:11:32,267
You're unbelievable.

195
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:35,000
I still have to drop by club activities.

196
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:36,633
Didn't we already have plans?

197
00:11:36,733 --> 00:11:39,233
- But I want to go, too.
- Then just skip it.

198
00:11:40,167 --> 00:11:41,667
- It's settled, then.
- Sweet!

199
00:11:41,767 --> 00:11:47,033
I knew it. There's no way
I can make Serizawa's heart race.

200
00:11:49,667 --> 00:11:51,900
Suzuki, what's wrong?

201
00:11:52,267 --> 00:11:54,133
What do you think?

202
00:11:54,500 --> 00:11:57,100
Serizawa's totally unfazed.

203
00:11:57,600 --> 00:12:00,133
Nothing is working out...

204
00:12:00,233 --> 00:12:01,500
Hmm...

205
00:12:02,867 --> 00:12:03,933
Let's see.

206
00:12:07,067 --> 00:12:09,967
How about I let you in on a little secret?

207
00:12:10,533 --> 00:12:11,567
A secret?

208
00:12:11,667 --> 00:12:12,733
Yeah.

209
00:12:13,033 --> 00:12:17,400
Do you know when Serizawa
loses his cool the most?

210
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:19,276
Aren't you the one who
always loves hanging out?

211
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:21,133
- For real?!
- Let's go, let's go.

212
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,200
Really?

213
00:12:30,233 --> 00:12:31,967
Hey, what are you two doing?

214
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:34,200
See? Told you so.

215
00:12:35,167 --> 00:12:35,867
What?

216
00:12:35,967 --> 00:12:37,200
What are you talking about?

217
00:12:39,267 --> 00:12:40,000
Saeki!

218
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,333
What did you tell Suzuki?

219
00:12:41,433 --> 00:12:42,467
Not telling.

220
00:12:42,567 --> 00:12:45,133
It's a secret between me and Suzuki.

221
00:12:45,233 --> 00:12:46,233
What?

222
00:12:47,433 --> 00:12:48,200
Suzuki, let's go.

223
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:49,333
Huh?

224
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,633
Hurry up.

225
00:12:54,167 --> 00:12:56,000
Wait...

226
00:12:58,467 --> 00:13:00,600
I just did you a huge favor!

227
00:13:06,233 --> 00:13:09,367
Hey, Suzuki, what was
that about back there?

228
00:13:10,267 --> 00:13:13,467
Tell me everything you two talked about.

229
00:13:14,733 --> 00:13:16,700
Everything...?

230
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:18,667
Where do I even start?

231
00:13:19,833 --> 00:13:22,000
From the beginning. Every single detail.

232
00:13:23,900 --> 00:13:27,367
Uh, first off...

233
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,567
I asked the guys for advice.

234
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:38,800
About... how ridiculously handsome you are.

235
00:13:41,033 --> 00:13:44,233
Oh. Not what I expected.

236
00:13:45,033 --> 00:13:45,867
Huh?

237
00:13:45,967 --> 00:13:48,300
Never mind. Keep going.

238
00:13:49,100 --> 00:13:53,733
And... I said that when we kiss,

239
00:13:53,833 --> 00:13:56,500
I'm bad at breathing through my nose,

240
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,400
so I wanted someone to practice with.

241
00:14:00,067 --> 00:14:01,500
You're way too serious about this.

242
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,900
It's not funny...

243
00:14:07,467 --> 00:14:10,567
I'm not laughing. That's
what's great about you.

244
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:16,000
But you seriously can't practice with them.

245
00:14:16,700 --> 00:14:20,033
If you want practice, I'll do it with
you as many times as you want.

246
00:14:21,367 --> 00:14:22,067
But...

247
00:14:22,167 --> 00:14:24,267
Come on, answer me.

248
00:14:26,733 --> 00:14:27,900
Okay.

249
00:14:28,267 --> 00:14:32,100
Let me make sure:
Who's the only one you're allowed to kiss?

250
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:37,033
I just wanted to practice nose breathing,
not actually kiss!

251
00:14:37,133 --> 00:14:38,900
Who are you allowed to kiss?

252
00:14:40,567 --> 00:14:43,433
O-Only you, Serizawa.

253
00:14:43,933 --> 00:14:45,067
Good.

254
00:14:45,233 --> 00:14:47,233
What else?

255
00:14:48,633 --> 00:14:53,433
Then we talked about how
my heart is always the only one racing.

256
00:14:54,367 --> 00:15:00,400
So they said I should try
to make your heart race instead.

257
00:15:01,433 --> 00:15:06,467
Ah, no wonder you were acting weird today.

258
00:15:07,900 --> 00:15:10,833
And then Saeki...

259
00:15:12,133 --> 00:15:15,133
What? Out with it.

260
00:15:17,067 --> 00:15:20,633
Well... Saeki said...

261
00:15:20,733 --> 00:15:23,167
the time you lose your cool the most...

262
00:15:25,133 --> 00:15:26,933
is when it comes to me...

263
00:15:27,033 --> 00:15:29,533
when you get jealous over me.

264
00:15:32,533 --> 00:15:34,167
Is that really true?

265
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:40,667
Don't just go quiet on me now!

266
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:45,033
Sorry. When I stay quiet,

267
00:15:45,133 --> 00:15:49,167
you look so adorably flustered,

268
00:15:49,267 --> 00:15:50,300
I couldn't help myself.

269
00:15:52,033 --> 00:15:54,167
You always do this, Serizawa!

270
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:56,533
Ah! Sorry!

271
00:15:58,700 --> 00:16:02,733
First time you've pinned me down.

272
00:16:04,533 --> 00:16:07,267
Now I can die happy.

273
00:16:08,833 --> 00:16:10,467
So frustrating...

274
00:16:11,833 --> 00:16:14,933
I knew it. I'm still the only one
with a racing heart.

275
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:19,400
Why do you have to smile
with that gorgeous face?

276
00:16:20,667 --> 00:16:22,167
It's so unfair.

277
00:16:22,267 --> 00:16:24,800
You're too hot! It's so frustrating!

278
00:16:26,067 --> 00:16:30,400
Am I getting chewed out
or complimented right now?

279
00:16:30,500 --> 00:16:31,767
Both!

280
00:16:38,467 --> 00:16:41,567
Mad Suzuki is adorable, too.

281
00:16:42,633 --> 00:16:44,233
Stop messing with me!

282
00:16:44,333 --> 00:16:45,867
I'm not.

283
00:16:48,833 --> 00:16:50,167
Hey, Suzuki.

284
00:16:50,933 --> 00:16:53,733
What Saeki said is true.

285
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,433
Liar.

286
00:16:56,533 --> 00:16:57,933
I'm not lying.

287
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:01,100
I'm not nearly as calm as you think.

288
00:17:01,733 --> 00:17:05,400
Even today, I was holding
back the whole time.

289
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:09,233
Because you've been
flirting with me all day.

290
00:17:11,900 --> 00:17:13,967
Like after gym class the other day...

291
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:15,933
I'm exhausted.

292
00:17:16,033 --> 00:17:18,067
Looks like I'll get around 25 points.

293
00:17:18,167 --> 00:17:19,467
I think so.

294
00:17:19,567 --> 00:17:21,267
Leave it to him and he'll do it for you.

295
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:26,833
Huh?

296
00:17:27,867 --> 00:17:29,600
You were being so cute,

297
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:31,167
I couldn't hold back,

298
00:17:31,833 --> 00:17:33,200
so I pulled you into the bathroom.

299
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:34,600
Hold on, Suzuki.

300
00:17:35,867 --> 00:17:37,100
Wait, I can't breathe.

301
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:39,433
It's okay.

302
00:17:39,733 --> 00:17:41,000
Breathe through your nose.

303
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:42,433
Suzuki.

304
00:17:42,533 --> 00:17:43,567
You can do it.

305
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,367
I can't do that...

306
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:47,667
It's too hard...

307
00:17:48,533 --> 00:17:50,000
So that's why you did that?

308
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:51,100
Yeah.

309
00:17:51,167 --> 00:17:52,267
Sorry.

310
00:17:54,067 --> 00:17:55,267
And another thing:

311
00:17:55,867 --> 00:17:58,367
Don't you ever do that
in front of anyone else.

312
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:02,733
And the day before yesterday, too...

313
00:18:03,167 --> 00:18:07,100
I really wanted Matsuno to check out
Ishibashi Tatakiware Sensei's new work.

314
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,609
I really wanted to show you this one.

315
00:18:08,633 --> 00:18:09,233
I see.

316
00:18:09,333 --> 00:18:10,933
- Cool, right?
- Totally cool.

317
00:18:11,033 --> 00:18:14,867
Plus, they really adapted that part
where Hasegawa sniffs around.

318
00:18:14,967 --> 00:18:17,967
And Mikasa's reaction was so good, too.

319
00:18:18,067 --> 00:18:19,900
Suzuki, come here a sec.

320
00:18:20,633 --> 00:18:21,733
What's up?

321
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:38,700
You two looked so close,
I couldn't help myself.

322
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:44,800
I'm not apologizing for that, though.

323
00:18:45,367 --> 00:18:47,133
I'll probably keep doing it.

324
00:18:48,333 --> 00:18:50,667
I... I had no idea.

325
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,833
Yeah, because I didn't tell you.

326
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:58,700
I'm crazy about you, Suzuki.

327
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:10,900
Do you not like a seme

328
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:13,600
who loses his cool and gets jealous?

329
00:19:16,333 --> 00:19:18,167
Of course I don't hate it.

330
00:19:19,067 --> 00:19:25,067
In fact, if it's you, Serizawa, I love it.

331
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:31,833
Then can I be more open
about being jealous at school, too?

332
00:19:32,900 --> 00:19:34,033
Yeah.

333
00:19:34,367 --> 00:19:35,667
You can.

334
00:19:36,267 --> 00:19:37,267
Really?

335
00:19:38,433 --> 00:19:41,400
I get pretty intense when I'm jealous.

336
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:42,900
Huh?

337
00:19:46,167 --> 00:19:48,100
Serizawa... wait.

338
00:19:48,467 --> 00:19:49,600
No.

339
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:52,667
I held back all day while you teased me.

340
00:19:53,900 --> 00:19:56,467
It's my turn now, right?

341
00:20:02,533 --> 00:20:04,233
I love you, Suzuki.

342
00:20:05,933 --> 00:20:09,767
I'm never letting you go,
so you'd better be ready.

343
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:45,033
And that's how Serizawa ended up
wearing me out for hours.

344
00:20:46,467 --> 00:20:48,600
Isn't that pretty good?

345
00:20:48,700 --> 00:20:49,909
It doesn't look like him at all.

346
00:20:49,933 --> 00:20:50,933
It does, though.

347
00:20:51,033 --> 00:20:52,200
Morning.

348
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:53,633
- Hey, morning.
- Morning.

349
00:20:53,733 --> 00:20:55,267
So, how'd it go?

350
00:20:55,367 --> 00:20:57,333
Did you make Serizawa's heart race?

351
00:20:58,467 --> 00:21:01,167
Don't ask. Please don't ask...

352
00:21:01,700 --> 00:21:02,900
Huh?

353
00:21:05,167 --> 00:21:10,867
Yeah, I don't even have time to wonder
if this is a dream anymore.

354
00:21:10,967 --> 00:21:12,233
It's practically...

355
00:21:12,333 --> 00:21:13,733
What kind of reaction is that?

356
00:21:14,467 --> 00:21:15,300
Hey, hey.

357
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,500
Huh?

358
00:21:16,833 --> 00:21:18,333
What exactly did Serizawa do to you?

359
00:21:18,433 --> 00:21:19,633
Hey...

360
00:21:19,733 --> 00:21:20,533
What did he do to you?

361
00:21:20,633 --> 00:21:21,673
He completely wore me out.

362
00:21:21,733 --> 00:21:22,733
Morning...

363
00:21:23,233 --> 00:21:25,900
Hey! You're way too close to him.

364
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,000
Huh?

365
00:21:27,367 --> 00:21:28,533
Hey.

366
00:21:29,433 --> 00:21:31,200
Suzuki is mine.

367
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:33,233
Know your place, all of you.

368
00:21:34,533 --> 00:21:36,367
S-Serizawa?!

369
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:38,900
Didn't I tell you?

370
00:21:39,833 --> 00:21:43,900
That I'm allowed to get
jealous at school from now on?

371
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:47,367
W-Well, yeah, but...

372
00:21:51,733 --> 00:21:53,633
Suzuki, you're way too close!

373
00:21:53,733 --> 00:21:55,600
Yay, whoa!

374
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:02,167
Hey.

375
00:22:02,267 --> 00:22:03,733
Serizawa is seriously...

376
00:22:03,833 --> 00:22:06,900
He acts so weird around Suzuki.

377
00:22:07,667 --> 00:22:08,900
Totally.

378
00:22:10,167 --> 00:22:11,200
What are you guys doing?

379
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:12,500
Hey.

380
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:13,700
Kabaddi.

381
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:16,300
Run, run, run!

382
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:17,933
I'll go check it out, too.

383
00:22:18,033 --> 00:22:19,033
No need, no, no, no.

384
00:22:19,067 --> 00:22:19,767
I'm coming, too.

385
00:22:19,867 --> 00:22:21,867
- That's not it!
- Wait up, Suzuki!

386
00:22:32,167 --> 00:22:33,600
Why are you running away?

387
00:22:34,133 --> 00:22:35,167
Because...

388
00:22:36,133 --> 00:22:39,333
Serizawa, you're so annoying.

389
00:22:40,267 --> 00:22:41,667
Oh...

390
00:22:41,767 --> 00:22:45,333
So, you don't like me, Suzuki?

391
00:22:46,933 --> 00:22:49,167
I... I do like you.

392
00:22:50,067 --> 00:22:51,200
I love you the most.
